onn Volume Bridge is an independent extraction and generalization of a local
Samsung-volume workaround developed in simo255/cleanyourtv, itself derived from
CleanYourTV/tv-vibehack by Gathin and contributors.

The original launcher, branding assets, fonts, device backups and user settings
are not included. The inherited Gradle wrapper and configuration are build tooling.
The MIT notice in LICENSE is retained for derived source.

Samsung protocol reference: https://github.com/xchwarze/samsung-tv-ws-api
Roku ECP: https://developer.roku.com/dev/docs/external-control-api
Sony Audio API: https://pro-bravia.sony.net/ja/remote-display-control/rest-api/reference/
ADB protocol: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/adb/+/refs/heads/main/OVERVIEW.TXT

No affiliation with Walmart/onn, Google, Samsung, Roku or Sony is implied.
